										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Since November, players have been peeking mid and rushing through the waters of Anubis.</p>
<p>Today we&#8217;re introducing the Anubis Collection, featuring 19 weapon finishes themed around the newest addition to Counter-Strike&#8217;s Active Duty map pool.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" src="https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/3381077/fd18c8adb36e6741b8729c4d6ffbb05cba467aa0.png" alt="" width="100%"/></p>
<p>The Anubis Collection is available for purchase now in-game.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
